<div id="resultApproximationModal" class="modal fade" role="dialog" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="resultApproximationModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h1 class="modal-title fs-5" id="resultApproximationModalLabel">Total Results Approximated</h1>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body" id="resultApproximationModalContent">
                The total number of results is approximated because search criteria were not applied to this search. If new scenes have been ingested since the daily data set approximation was ran, you may be unable to access a few
                results through this paginated interface. Applying any criteria on the "Search Criteria" or "Additional Criteria" tabs will ensure you can access all results.
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>



<div id="metadataExportDialog" title="Metadata Export" data-noBrowseInKmzDatasets=''>
    <div id="metadataExportError" class="alert alert-warning" style="display: none;"></div>
    <div class="mb-3">
        <label for="exportName">Export Name</label>
        <input type="text" id="exportName" name="exportName" maxlength="256" class="form-control" value="" aria-describedby="exportNameHelp" />
        <div class="invalid-feedback"></div>
        <small id="exportNameHelp" class="form-text text-muted" style="display: none;">What do you want to call this export? If left blank, we'll generate a random token.</small>
    </div>
    <div class="mb-3">
        <label for="exportFormatSelector">Export Format</label>
        <select id="exportFormatSelector" name="exportFormatSelector" title="Export Format Selector" class="form-select" aria-describedby="exportFormatSelectorHelp">
                        <option value="csv">CSV</option>
            <option value="kmz_browse">KMZ - Include Browse</option>
            <option value="kmz_nobrowse">KMZ - No Browse</option>
            <option value="delimited_comma">Comma (,) Delimited</option>
            <option value="delimited_pipe">Pipe (|) Delimited</option>            
            <option value="shapefile">Shapefile</option>
            <option value="fgdc">FGDC</option>
        </select>
        <div class="invalid-feedback"></div>
        <small id="exportFormatSelectorHelp" class="form-text text-muted" style="display: none;">Select an export format</small>
    </div>
    <div class="mb-3">
        <div id="excludeListContainer" style="display: none;">
            <input id="excludeList" type="checkbox" title="Do not export excluded scenes" name="excludeScenes" checked>
            <label title="Do not export Excluded scenes" for="excludeList">Do not export "Excluded" scenes</label>
        </div>
    </div>    
</div>

<div id="exportRequestModal" class="modal fade" role="dialog" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="exportRequestModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h1 class="modal-title fs-5" id="exportRequestModalLabel">Export Requested for Processing</h1>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                We are processing your export request.              
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div id="exportGenerationModal" class="modal fade" role="dialog" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="exportGenerationModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h1 class="modal-title fs-5" id="exportGenerationModalLabel">Export Submitted for Processing</h1>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body" id="exportGenerationModalContent">
                Large exports may take several hours to process during periods of high demand.                
                Once processing has finished, an e-mail will be sent to the address associated with your ERS account. Real-time status updates can be found on the export status page.
                You may return to your results at any time, it will not impact the processing of your export.
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
                <button id="exportLogButton" type="button" class="btn btn-secondary">Open Export Status Page</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div id='rollDialog' title="Scene View" style='display: none;'>
    <div id='rollDialogContent'></div>
</div>

<div class="modal fade" id="eulaModal" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="eulaModalLongTitle" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-lg" role="document" style="max-width: 800px !important;">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h1 class="modal-title fs-5" id="eulaModalLongTitle">End-User License Agreement (EULA)</h1>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body" style="max-height: calc(100vh - 210px); overflow-y: auto;">
                You are attempting to download licenses data - this requires acknowledgement of an End-User License Agreement. Please
                review the agreement content and click "I Agree" to proceed to your download.
                <div id="eulaAgreement"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancel</button>
                <button type="button" id="eulaAgreeButton" class="btn btn-primary">I Agree - Continue to Download</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

